      "writtenOn": "2023-05-31T12:23:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To support downstream tethering interfaces, I added a constructor with an interfaceIndex parameter only. The Network parameter is always null for downstream tethering interfaces. For other interfaces, these parameters are available when creating a socket. Additionally, this change refactored the code so that the Network and interface index are now bundled together and can be provided to the user together.",
